+## D008 - Authorized parameterization and physical observation boundary
+
+**Decision:** Following independent human review of Phase 1 commit
+`ae309e3183608a52efb3b7feb4813c4942b03637`, qualify exactly S=2,4,8 using one
+generic output-stationary PE fabric and explicit token model. Preserve the
+Phase 1 arithmetic/clear/last/masked-completion/cycle contract and all 147
+audited input cases, including exact S=2 output and tile-cycle compatibility.
+Functional wrappers expose C for verification; physical wrappers keep C and
+MAC cones internal with Yosys keep semantics and empirical structural audits.
+No result serializer, memory interface or large result pin bus is added.
+
+**Reason:** Qualify the compute fabric without artificial chip-edge result
+fanout; maintain one matched architecture at the three authorized sizes.
+The root pytest.ini restricts discovery to tests as a repository hygiene fix;
+old Phase 1 snapshots and test evidence are not rewritten.
+
+## D009 - Pre-physical backend and timing methodology freeze
+
+**Decision:** Before accelerator synthesis/P&R, commit the pinned recipe in
+flow/phase2_backend_recipe.json, its document, the physical view, RTL/wrappers,
+and docs/PHASE2_TIMING_METHODOLOGY.md with the explicit post-route R2R Tcl.
+Use OpenLane 2.3.10 Classic, the authorized digest-pinned image, sky130A
+revision 0fe599b2afb6708d281543108caf8310912f54af and sky130_fd_sc_hd; clk,
+20.0 ns, FP_CORE_UTIL=30, pinned defaults and identical jobs/settings.
+No unsupported seed key is invented. The explicit maximum/setup query uses
+final routed artifacts and max_ss_100C_1v60; P_sta_est=20-S_r2r must be positive
+and F_sta=1000/P_sta_est MHz is parser-derived. This is a post-route fixed-layout
+STA-derived frequency estimate, not a silicon measurement or a clock sweep.
+
+**Reason:** Fix the measurement method before results exist. After first
+accelerator physical metrics, recipe/timing changes require STOP and human
+review. Preserve negative setup evidence without retuning, but block on missing
+compute logic, invalid provenance/timing, hold or enabled signoff failure.
+Phase 2 contains per-configuration qualification only; Phase 3 research ranking
+and interpretation remain unauthorized.
